# Every text file is LF in the repository AND in every checkout, Windows included.
# test-vectors.json is compared byte for byte with what ts/src/gen_vectors.ts prints (LF), the
# docs-test snapshots are hashed, spend/openapi.yaml is matched by a regex with \n, and the
# shell scripts must not carry \r. Without this, Git for Windows' default core.autocrlf=true
# checks them out as CRLF and the vector diff, the snapshot hashes and those checks fail.
* text=auto eol=lf
